			<div class="content" id="post-content-1413879">
									

<p>The prayer is there for a few reasons. For one, most of the articles we have with a faith-based element have been deleted or ARC'd. It also serves as a handy reason why the D-Class was able to do the job when the agents weren't. He managed to keep his faith (partly by having forewarning of what was at the nest). For the other&#8230; For some things, there is no training. And thinking you <em>are</em> trained for it is detrimental in the long run. That's part of why Barclay lost his nerve.</p>

